hymns.text:
1. Atate wa Kumwambako,
Munawombola ife ndi
Chikondi chanu chijacho;
Tiyamikira Inutu.

2. Ambuye Yesu, Inutu
Munabadwira anthu ’fe;
Munatifera tonsefe;
Tiyamikira Inutu.

3. Mzimu Woyera, m’mtimamo
Tiyeretsedwe ndinutu;
Munatisunga bwinoli;
Tiyamikira Inutu.

4. Atate, Mwana, Mzimunso,
Ndinu Atatu Mmodzitu,
Ochimwa tikupemphani:
Mutikhululukire ’fe.

1. Idza wolema,
Akupumitsa;
Womva chisoni,
Akutonthoza;
Mlendo, limbika,
Mphamvu apatsa
Amatisunga,
Yesu Ambuye.

2. Ndiye mtsamiro
Pogona ine;
Pofika kufa
Andidzutsanso;
Podzichepetsa
Andikwezanso;
Moyo wa moyo,
Yesu Ambuye.

3. Ndikakhumudwa
Andilimbitsa;
Ndikadzitama
Andichepetsa;
Ndikasokera;
Andilondola;
E! Wokondedwa
Yesu Ambuye.

4. Ndimachitira
Inu umboni;
Ndikukuzani
Moyamikira;
Mphamvu ndi nzeru,
Moyo, zonsezi,
Si zanga, nzanu,
Yesu Ambuye.

1. Idzani, Mzimu Inu,
Mundidalitse kuno;
Ndafoka mtima ine
Polendo wanga uno;
Kwambiri ndakhumudwa
Panjirayo ya moyo;
Mkaleka kutsogola
Ndiwonongeka pompo.

2. Wakunga mwana ine,
Sindidziwitsa konse;
Mundilandize Mzimu;
Panjira yanga yonse;
Mundiyendetse bwino
Ndifike ine ndemwe
Panjira yolungama,
Kudziko lachimwemwe.

3. Mundilimbitse m’mtima
Pogwira ntchito izi;
Ndikapumula pena
Mukhale ndithu ndine;
Zolingirira zanga
Ziyere zonse m’mtima;
Zoipa muzichotse,
Sindidzazichitanso.

1. Tadza kukudyaku,
Kwakonzedwatu;
Mkate wamoyodi,
Idyatu ’we;
Bwera wochimwanso,
Yesu adikatu,
Akuitanaku;
Mvetsatu ’we.

2. Tadza kumtsinjeku
Wa moyo weni,
Chiza zowawazo
Za m;mtimamo;
Mtsinje wodzalawo,
Wokwaniratuwo
Yesu sakana ’yi;
Idzatu ’we.

3. M’dzina la Yesuyo
Pemphatu iwe,
Iye adzamvatu,
Dikirapo.
Wamphamvu Mlunguyo
Ndiye apatsatu,
Dalo labwinolo;
Idzatu ’we.

4. Yamba ulendowo
Wonka Kumwamba;
Pano mpoipatu
Padzikoli;
Komwe tikondwako,
Tidzasekeranso;
tinke Kumwambako;
Idzatu ’we.

1. Kwa Inu Yesu ndilira,
Wopanda Inu ndidzafa;
Mupulumutse inedi,
Mundilandiretu.

Mundilandiretu,
Ndiipa m’mtimamo;
Kotero mnandiferatu,
Mundilandiretu.

2. Ndifoka ndi zoipazo,
Ndidzalatu ndi machimo,
Sinditha kuzitayazo;
Mundilandiretu.

3. Ndayesa kudzikonzadi,
Ndapeza mphamvu ndilibe,
Zoipa zakanikadi;
Mundilandiretu.

4. Onani Mbuye ndigonja,
Kuyesa kwanga ndaleka;
Chitani Inu mumtima;
Mundilandiretu.

5. Muyambe ntchito yanuyi,
Musalekenso, chitani;
Ndidzipereka leroli;
Mundilandiretu.

1. Ambuye, ndifuna nditsukenitu;
Mukhale ndine mumtimamangamu;
Muthyole zonsezo zodetsa ’netu;
Musambitse ine, ndiyeretu mbuu!

Ndiyere mbuu! E, ndiyere mbuu!
Mundisambitse ine, ndiyeretu mbuu!

2. Ambuye, chotsani zonse zomwezo
Zakundisautsa mumtimangamu;
Ndileke zangazo zoipa ’netu;
Mundisambitse ine, ndiyeretu mbuu!

3. Kumwamba ndiona Ambuyangayo,
Mudzandithandiza, nditsate ’nemo;
Mudzandichotsera zoletsa ’netu;
Musambitse ine, ndiyera mbuu!

4. Chifukwa cha ichi ndipempheratu,
Ndidikira Inu Ambuyangayu;
Ndikhulupirira pa mwaziwo pyu!
Musambitse ine, ndiyeretu mbuu!

1. Tithawiranji ifetu?
Mphamvu za Yesu nzathunzo.
Kristu atithangatatu
M’nkhondo ya moyo wathuyo.

2. Yendani bwino m’njiramo
Ya kwa Mulungu wathuyo;
Kwezani maso kuli ’Ye;
Kristu ndi njira yomweyo.

3. Nkhawa tilibe; Yesuyo
Atsogolera m’njiramo;
Tikhulupire Iyeyo,
Kristu ndi moyo wathuwo.

4. Tioperanji ifetu?
Ali pafupi Mbuyeyu;
Sangasinthike mtima ’yi;
Kristu akonda ifetu.

1. Yesu afuna iwe unnke kwawoko,
Lowa m’njira yake yakuyerayeratu;
Anadzera m’Mwamba kutiperekezako;
Yamba msanga iwe kunka kwanuko.

Tsata, tsata, nditsatadi Yesu;
Iwetu, iwetu, ukatsatanso.
Tsata, tsata, nditsatadi Yesu;
Inu nonse mukatsate Mbuyeyo.

2. Ngati umtsata Mpulumutsi wakoyo,
Udzakhaliranso kuli Mbuye
wakoyo;
Adzapulumutsa thupi, mzimu wakonso,
M’mphamvu ndi chilango cha zoipazo.

3. Kunsi kudambo, pena m’mwamba m’phirimo,
Pomwe pali Yesu ndidzayendayendapo;
Andiperekeza bwino m’njira yakeyo,
Kuli Mzinda wa Mulungu wangayo.

1. Mbuye munditsogolere,
Ndine mlendo m’dziko muno;
Ndikafoka mundikweze,
Mundisunge m’manja mwanu;
Mundidyetse, mundidyetse,
Sindingamve njalayo.

2. Mundimwetse madzi anu,
Andichize nthenda zanga;
Utsogole mtambo wanu,
Ndikadziwe njira yanga;
Mpulumutsi, Mpulumutsi,
Munditchinjirizetu.

3. Ndikalowa m’mtsinje muja,
Mndichotsere mantha onse;
Mndilowetse tsidya lija,
Ndikondwere nthawi zonse;
Nyimbo zanga, nyimbo zanga
Zidzalemekeza ’Nu.

1. Akristu ndi abale, tiziyenderana tonse,
Mulungu mmodzi tili naye, ndi
Ambuye yemwe,
Chitsime chomwe, njira yomwe yokhulupirira;
Tiyeni tonse, m’Mpingo ’modzi tiziyenderana.

2. Atate yemwe anatuma Mpulumutsi mmodzi
Kudzatifera kuti atiyanjanitse tonse,
Ndi Mzimu yemwe ayeretsa akumvera onse;
Tiyeni tonse, m’Mpingo ’modzi tiziyenderana.

3. Anatipatsa Mawu onse olimbitsa mtima;
Kumwamba komwe tinka ndi kulonda njira yomwe.
Tibalalikiranji ife akutsata Yesu?
Tiyeni tonse, m’Mpingo ’modzi tiziyenderana.

4. Satana apambana tikayamba kusiyana;
Tikayanjana, yemwe adzagonja ndi kuthawa;
Mbuyathu adzamthyola konse ndi kumlamulira.
Tiyeni tonse, m’Mpingo ’modzi tiziyenderana.

5. Tiphatikane tonsefe okonda Yesu Kristu;
Tisalekane pakugwira ntchito za Mbuyathu;
Tilimbitsane pakuyenda m’njira yonka kwathu.
Tiyeni tonse, m’Mpingo ’modzi tiziyenderana.

1. Mbuye, Mpingo wanu usauka kwa kukuludi;
Kale lija munatsitsa Mzimu wanu Wakuyera;
Lero linonso muchite, ulimbike
Mpingo wanu.

2. Tidza kwa Mulungu Inu, ndinu wa chifundo;
Mutipatse Mzimu wanu tsopanoli,
tere lino;
Tikakhale ndi chimwemw kuti tilimbike ndithu.

3. A! maliro m’Mpingo mwanu kulirira ’balewo
Adasokerera kale ndi zoipa zapa dziko.
Muwabwezerenso kwanu kuti.
akakhale mommo.

4. Ndi chikondi mtithandize kuigwira nkhondoyi;
Mwa kulema ndi kulimba mutipempherere ife,
Kuti tilimbane naye Satanayo,
osam’wopa.

5. Pakubweradi Woyesa tidzamlaka ifetu;
Angelonso adzabwera kutithandizira ife
Kuti tilimbike ife ndi kumchotsa m’mtima mwathu.

6. Pa la Mulungu tibwera kulandira zidazo;
Mphamvu yanu ndi chikondi zititsogolere ife;
Machitidwe ndi mkhalidwe zikokere ena kwanu.

1. Mukhale ndine, dzuwalo lalowa,
Wagwa usiku, bwenzi lindisowa;
Ndilibe wina wakundithandiza,
Wamphamvu ndinu, mkhale ndinetu.

2. Kamoyo kanga katha lero lino,
Zidzachokanso zinthuzo za dziko;
Zimasinthika zonse zooneka,
Simusinthika, mkhale ndinetu.

3. Koma kalelo mnakhalitsa pano,
Mukhale ndine, msandichokerenso,
Sin’pempha kuti Mbuye mungotsotse,
Komatu mukhalitse ndinetu.

4. E, tsiku lonse Inu ndifunitsa;
Ndi mphamvu yanu yokha ndisungika;
Mukatsogola ndidzadikha mtima;
Usiku, msana, mkhale ndinetu.

5. Adani sindiopa mukalipo;
Muletse tsoka ndi chisoni chino;
Ikadza imfa n’dzalimbika m’mtima;
M’moyo ndi m’imfa mkhale ndinetu.

1. Sindili woyenera ’ne,
Ambuye, kudzamo;
Munene mawu, ndimvebe
Okondweretsawo.

2. Sindili woyenera ’ne;
Mumtima mwanga zi;
Munene, ndikachiradi,
Ndilibe moyo ’yi.

3. Sindili woyenera ’ne;
Pamtanda panupo
Munamaliza mlandu phe
Ndi mwazi wanuwo.

4. Ndilawako tsopanoli
Zakudya zanuzo;
Mudzaze mtima wanga ndi
Kukonda kwanuko.

1. Ambuye, Mwini zonsezi,
Ulemu tiperekadi;
Chikondi tionetsanji?
Mwatipatsatu.

2. Dzuwa ndi mvula yonseyo
Ndi mame mwatipatsanso,
Masika ’dzera kwanuko;
Mwapatsatu’

3. Mwapatsa Mwana wanu, ndi
Mapulumutsa dzikoli;
E, zaulere zonsezi
Mwapatsatu.

4. Tibwezeretu bwanjiko?
Ziperewera zathuzi;
Ndi moyo tili nawowo
Mwapatsatu.

5. Ambuye zathu zonsezi
Kwa Inu tibwezeredi;
Tingopereka zanuzi;
Mwapatsatu.

1. Mpulumutsi, Mbusa wathu,
Mutitsogolere ife;
Mutiwete, mutisunge,
M’khola mwanu mtilandire;
Yesu wathu, Yesu wathu,
Mnatigula ana anu.

2. Ndife ana, mutikonda,
M’njira mutiperekeze;
Mchotse nsoni ndi zoipa,
Osokera muwabweze;
Yesu wathu, Yesu wathu,
Mumve mapemphero athu.

3. Munanena mulandira
Osauka ndi oipa;
Inu ndinu wachifundo
Ndi wamphamvu yolanditsa;
Yesu wathu, Yesu wathu,
Tidzatu tiana tanu.

4. Tifunitsa Inu tere,
Chifuniro chanu ndicho;
Mbuye wathu, Mpulumutsi,
Mutikonzetu m’katimo;
Yesu wathu, Yesu wathu,
Mtikondebe ana anu.

1. Yesu, muli pa chimpando
Chakuwala mbee! Kumwamba;
Mutipenya ife ana;
Mutimvere, Yesu.

2. Ife ana sitiopa,
Mukabwera mutiona,
Tamva kale mutikonda;
Mutimvere, Yesu.

3. Ife tikondana nanu,
tiimba nyimbo zanu,
tiyamika mphamvu yanu;
Mutimvere, Yesu.

4. Lero mkhale nafe ndithu,
Posewera ndi pantchito,
Popemphera ndi poimba;
Mutimvere, Yesu.

5. Mutiletse tisaname
Ndi kunena zotukwana,
Mtiphunzitse kukondana;
Mutimvere, Yesu.

1. Mlungu akuyang’aniredi
Kufikira tionana;
Adzasunga nkhosa zake;
Mlungu akuyang’nairedi.

E! tidzakomanansotu
Pamapazi a Yesu;
E! tidzakomanansotu;
Mlungu akuyang’aniredi.

2. Mlungu akuyang’aniredi,
M’dzanja mwake akulere,
Ndi mapiko akubise;
Mlungu akuyang’aniredi.

1. Kwathu sipadziko, ndingopitirira,
Ndadzikundikira chuma Kumwambako;
Mngelo akodola pakhomo la m’mwamba;
Ndipo dziko lapansi sindyesa kwathu.

Mbuye ndinu bwenzi langa ndithu,
Ndichitenji ngati Kumwamba sikwathu?
Mngelo akodola pakhomo la m’Mwamba,
Ndipo dziko lapansi sindiyesa kwathu.

2. Andiyembekeza, chinthuchi ndidziwa,
Mpulumutsi wanga wandikhulukira;
Adzandipyoletsa pamene ndafoka;
Ndipo dziko lapansi sindiyesa kwathu.

3. Mayi watsogola ku Ulemerero,
Ndifuna kugwira dzanja lake konko,
Andidikiranso pakhomo la’Mwamba;
Ndipo dziko lapansi sindiyesa kwathu.

4. Mu ulemerero tidzakhala m’yaya,
Oyera mtimawo ali kulamira;
Ati, "Aleluya kwa Mlungu Wamphamvu."
Ndipo dziko lapansi sindiyesa kwathu.

1. Ambiri tikondwera mwa Yesu,
Nanga inu? Nanga inu?
Tapeza chipulumutso ndithu;
Nanga inu? Nanga inu?

Masiku onse timakondwera
Pakumva Mawu ake a Yesu;
Wolalikira tidzamumvera;
Nanga inu? Nanga inu?

2. Ife tiyembekezera Yesu,
Nanga inu? Nanga inu?
Chimwemwecho chili mumtimamu;
Nanga inu?

3. Titasokera tinabwerera,
Nanga inu? Nanga inu?
Tadziwa kuti ndiwo uchimo;
Nanga inu?

4. Tinachoka munjira ya imfa,
Nanga inu? Nanga inu?
Takopeka ndi Mawu a Yesu;
Nanga inu?
